  "name": "pdh-guam_population_grid_2020",
  "notes": "Population Raster Guam 2020 Data Input: \r\nSettlement footprint from Facebook's High-Resolution Population Density Maps https://data.humdata.org/dataset/guam-high-resolution-population-density-maps-demographic-estimates Population allocated proportionally using 2011 census population counts at district level. Year Population Growth Rate of 1.64% has been applied to update population up to 2020\r\nThe human settlement footprint with census population allocated has been converted into a 100 m resolution raster.\r\n\n\n_Access this dataset from the [Pacific Data Hub](https://pacificdata.org/data/dataset/gum_population_grid_2020)_",
